    {
      "id": "claim_aa94da450291437282fadf7d9a34d5ff",
      "statement": "The invitation acceptance page is one Accept component registered at two paths — `/auth/activate` for a new user and `/invitations/accept` for an existing user — with no `meta.guard`, so the global `beforeEach` leaves it unguarded and it can serve signed-out invitees, signed-in users, and people without an account.",
