    {
      "id": "claim_c86cac1b54d6429799a6dd89443b04f4",
      "statement": "A `watch` on `rhAuth.store.user` in `src/main.ts` redirects to `/auth/login` when the session ends while an `auth`-guarded route is open, because Vue Router's `beforeEach` guard runs only on navigation and would otherwise leave the user on a page they can no longer access.",
